## Attribution
ARCUS extends and builds upon the Spec Driven Development methodology pioneered
by GitHub Spec-Kit (https://github.com/github/spec-kit), also licensed under MIT.
ARCUS's primary contribution is the addition of context engineering, skills-based
architecture, and distributed agent orchestration to the core SDD methodology.
